<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; color: rgb(17, 25, 0)">Indicate by check mark whether the registrant
is an emerging growth company as defined in Rule&#160;405 of the Securities Act of 1933 <span style="color: rgb(17, 25, 0)">(&#167;230.405
of this chapter) or Rule 12b-2 of the Securities Exchange Act of 1934 (&#167;240.12b-2 of this chapter).</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; color: rgb(17, 25, 0)">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0.5in 0pt 0; text-align: right"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">Emerging
growth company&#160; </span><span style="font-family: Wingdings"><span id="xdx_90C_edei--EntityEmergingGrowthCompany_c20230811__20230811_zHuSsXXBvD4a"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="AsOf2023-08-11" format="ixt:booleanfalse" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany">&#168;</ix:nonNumeric></span></span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; color: rgb(17, 25, 0)">If
an emerging growth company, indicate by check mark if the registrant has elected not to use the extended transition period for&#160;complying
with any new or revised financial </span><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">accounting
standards provided pursuant to Section&#160;13(a) of the Exchange Act. &#160;</span><span style="font-family: Wingdings"><span style="font-family: Wingdings">&#168;</span></span></p>


<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">&#160;</p>

