<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b><i>Please note that if you hold securities
through a brokerage account, there may be additional delays before these transactions are reflected in your securities account. You are
encouraged to contact your broker with any questions.</i></b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

